  "notes": "COMPOUND VERB:\n{駆|か}ける (to run, to gallop) + {上|あ}がる (to go up)\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n{自動詞|じどうし} (intransitive) - takes を for the path being traversed\n\nRELATED COMPOUND VERBS:\n- {駆|か}け{下|お}りる: to run down\n- {駆|か}け{込|こ}む: to rush in\n- {駆|か}け{回|まわ}る: to run around\n- {駆|か}け{抜|ぬ}ける: to run through\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {階段|かいだん}を{駆|か}け{上|あ}がる: to run up the stairs\n- {坂|さか}を{駆|か}け{上|あ}がる: to run up a slope",
